  "local_changes": "src/footer/deserializer.rs adds fallible session-allocator footer growth and allocator-owned DType/layout FlatBuffer copies. src/open.rs routes native opens through fallible growth, preserves already aligned cached slices, and allocates required segment realignment and requested user-metadata copies through the session allocator. The existing raw prefix_data compatibility API remains explicitly unbounded. A private upstream bounds test supplies the session to the changed private helper. src/tests.rs replaces the nullable-root expected-panic fixture with reopened metadata, complete logical-child values and omitted unmasked-child-statistics assertions for the already admitted layout provider contract; raw nullable-root projection remains a separate provider limitation. Cargo.toml is marked publish=false; license, provenance, README.shardloom.md and a crate-local Cargo.lock ignore rule are added. File, array, layout, dependency-version and serialization identities remain unchanged. Structural metadata, writer scratch and process RSS are outside this finite byte-buffer contract."
